data: {"level":3,"reviewed":{"level":3,"label":"code shape","text":"Make the function a generator: `iter()` each stream first, then prime the heap with `next(iterator,\nsentinel)` so an empty stream is not an error. Use `heapq.heappush` and `heapq.heappop` only. In the loop,\npop, `yield`, then refill that stream. Do not call `list()` on a stream, and do not sort the whole input."},"hints_note":null}

